  (vector "kotoba-lang/kotobase-storage-d1/src/worker.mjs:21,72,146-152,260,305-596 -- D1 is default CAS arbiter, R2-authority mode exists as alternate Cloudflare-only mode"
   "net-kotobase/control-plane/inga-replica/js/inga-replica-worker.js -- inga replica running as 4 Durable Objects, README states 'Not production. There is no route outside env.testnet' and 'one Cloudflare account, one operator, one secret holding every validator seed'"
